    <string name="help_body">Ultimate Playmakers is a block-puzzle career game.\n\n• Drag a block from the tray onto the grid — it lifts above your finger so you can see the drop.\n• Fill a whole row or column and it clears for points. Clear on back-to-back drops to build a combo multiplier.\n• Out of room? Tap the refresh button to swap your three blocks (limited charges).\n• Clear career challenges to earn coins, XP and stars, and unlock new divisions.\n• Spend coins in the Shop on gear and boosts, and upgrade your attributes.\n• Take on Targets, Time Attack and knockout Tournaments.\n• Complete missions and achievements and climb the leaderboard.\n\nThink two blocks ahead — leave yourself room and chase the all-clear!</string>
